#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:2 66e5e6581bae4dbbbdca16364ea7074a
msgid "Agent Skills"
msgstr "智能体技能"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:4 577c998fa54a433597aeca959e86e3c6
msgid ""
"PyBroker ships `Agent Skills <https://agentskills.io/specification>`_ "
"that give coding agents workflows for writing strategies, indicators, "
"models, and backtests."
msgstr ""
"PyBroker 内置了 `智能体技能 <https://agentskills.io/specification>`_，"
"为编程智能体提供编写策略、指标、模型和回测的工作流程。"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:9 a541a78491d14943b17e20685cd09a49
msgid "Get the Skills Library"
msgstr "获取技能库"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:11 ed83859e1b3b4b98b93898f913b3187a
msgid ""
"Public skills live under the ``skills/`` directory in the PyBroker `Git "
"repository <https://github.com/edtechre/pybroker>`_. Each skill is "
"contained in its own folder and defined by a standard ``SKILL.md`` file."
msgstr ""
"公开技能位于 PyBroker `Git 仓库 <https://github.com/edtechre/pybroker>`_ "
"中的 ``skills/`` 目录下。每个技能都存放在各自的文件夹中，并由标准的 "
"``SKILL.md`` 文件定义。"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:15 447dc3c8f75b49b88fb80048834560d5
msgid ""
"To access them, simply clone the PyBroker repository to your local "
"machine:"
msgstr "要获取这些技能，只需将 PyBroker 仓库克隆到本地机器："

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:24 a742412237264cd6b695d6c6f1e4caa8
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:27 30e9a3a21d0343e3b4716e97ec880c50
msgid "Claude Code"
msgstr "Claude Code"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:29 ab433984bed74e20b013f102b1d8eeba
msgid ""
"`Claude Code <https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills>`_ automatically "
"discovers skills placed inside a ``.claude/skills/`` folder in your "
"project root. To install all PyBroker skills at once, you can symlink the"
" entire contents of the repository's ``skills/`` directory:"
msgstr ""
"`Claude Code <https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills>`_ 会自动发现放置在"
"项目根目录下 ``.claude/skills/`` 文件夹中的技能。要一次性安装所有 "
"PyBroker 技能，你可以将仓库 ``skills/`` 目录下的全部内容软链接过去："

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:44 4a187ee4bd5b4c69bec31396f53cc064
msgid ""
"Claude Code will now automatically discover every skill and make their "
"respective commands available in the terminal."
msgstr "现在，Claude Code 将自动发现每个技能，并使其对应的命令在终端中可用。"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:48 62502e6bb58a423889b0dbb06e89a561
msgid "OpenAI Codex"
msgstr "OpenAI Codex"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:50 8ac6223cc6384e3e8b1601fa9ca57329
msgid ""
"`OpenAI Codex <https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/build-skills>`_ discovers "
"skills in ``.agents/skills/``. Symlink the PyBroker skills there:"
msgstr ""
"`OpenAI Codex <https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/build-skills>`_ 会在 "
"``.agents/skills/`` 中发现技能。将 PyBroker 技能软链接到该目录："

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:62 96cb2b1745974336b8ffb27abacd08c9
msgid "Cursor"
msgstr "Cursor"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:64 bc947c7ba8154b3eaf6170142d159d39
msgid ""
"`Cursor <https://cursor.com/docs/skills>`_ discovers skills in "
"``.cursor/skills/``. Install them the same way:"
msgstr ""
"`Cursor <https://cursor.com/docs/skills>`_ 会在 ``.cursor/skills/`` 中"
"发现技能。使用相同的方式安装它们："

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:77 13abdfb64bb1470aafaa9dc2b8f23855
msgid "Claude Agent SDK"
msgstr "Claude Agent SDK"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:79 c3bb48ac75c04d63b78e471a998dd85b
msgid ""
"The `Claude Agent SDK <https://code.claude.com/docs/en/agent-"
"sdk/skills>`_ discovers skills from the same ``.claude/skills/`` symlinks"
" created above, so it loads them on demand and invokes them automatically"
" without any prompt assembly:"
msgstr ""
"`Claude Agent SDK <https://code.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/skills>`_ "
"会从上面创建的相同 ``.claude/skills/`` 软链接中发现技能，因此它可以按需"
"加载这些技能，并自动调用它们，无需任何提示词拼装："

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:115 382dd7a5e93a42ad81d33f53cdf92ea8
msgid "Pydantic-AI"
msgstr "Pydantic-AI"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:117 a6f8f92717674b8f8536c26340e221c5
msgid ""
"`Pydantic-AI <https://pydantic.dev/docs/ai/>`_ builds agents in pure "
"Python. It does not search for skill directories automatically, so you "
"point its `Skills <https://pydantic.dev/docs/ai/harness/skills/>`_ "
"capability at the ``.agents/skills`` library created above:"
msgstr ""
"`Pydantic-AI <https://pydantic.dev/docs/ai/>`_ 使用纯 Python 构建智能体。"
"它不会自动搜索技能目录，因此你需要将其 `Skills "
"<https://pydantic.dev/docs/ai/harness/skills/>`_ 能力指向上面创建的 "
"``.agents/skills`` 库："

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:140 63b8fd7f47d0415ab7ab5cb08dc02b56
msgid "Available Skills"
msgstr "可用技能"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:145 67797395d59746518c5064116e8203ba
msgid "pybroker-strategy-creator"
msgstr "pybroker-strategy-creator"

#: ../../../skills/pybroker-strategy-creator/SKILL.md:3
#: 7b871951ae834b049f8f3b6f7e6d481f
msgid ""
"Create practical PyBroker strategy code from user intent while preserving"
" backtest hygiene: no lookahead leakage, explicit sizing, clear risk "
"controls, and locally valid PyBroker API usage."
msgstr ""
"根据用户意图生成实用的 PyBroker 策略代码，同时保持良好的回测规范：无"
"前视泄漏、明确的仓位规模、清晰的风险控制，以及符合规范的 PyBroker API "
"用法。"

